Rule 2 (if input is complex, other must also be complex)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if 9 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10 then 9 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 10
