Rule 4 (If input is a scalar, other must be a tensor with numerical dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then 1 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 8
