Rule 6 (If input is float tensor, the other cannot be bool tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 then dtype_(v_2) ≠ 0
