Rule 7 (If input is an int tensor, other must be an int tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 then 1 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5
